# Runtime state, never source. The live policy is read from LOTOR_HOME
# (bin/hook-pre-tool-use.js, bin/hook-post-tool-use.js, bin/mode.js all
# resolve it against the home dir, never against the repo). A policy.json
# committed here would be a decoy: editing it to tighten your gate would
# change nothing, and a pull could silently alter someone's enforcement.
policy.json

